  v_preview := $em$$em$;
  v_body := $em$<!--bc:rich-email--><p style="line-height: 1.38;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Hey {{first_name}},</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.38;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">You start writing your bio, then wonder whether getting specific means turning away someone you could help.</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.38;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">So you rewrite it. Again.</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.38;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">The Private Practice Starter Suite gives you a focused way to explore your niche and business model. Its exercises help you describe who you want to serve and think through how you’ll structure your practice.</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.38;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">You can use that clarity to draft your service description and begin choosing relevant outreach actions. It’s a manageable piece of preparing for the practice you want.</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.38;"><a href="https://www.bossclinician.com/startersuitecourse"><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); background-color: transparent;"><b>See the Starter Suite</b></span></a></p><p style="line-height: 1.38;"><a href="https://www.bossclinician.com/startersuitecourse"><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); background-color: transparent;">https://www.bossclinician.com/startersuitecourse</span></a></p><p style="line-height: 1.38;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">To your success,</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.38;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;">Yvette Howard, LCSW</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.38;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0,